00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.760
Lloyd: So now that you've completed
session three of unit five, it's

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:05.280
time to complete the relevant
section of the assessment booklet.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.340
